{"arm": "vs", "model": "z-ai/glm-5.3-flashx", "i": 7, "finish": "stop", "dirs": [{"direction": "Editorial calm: warm paper background, serif display type, generous whitespace, an inline SVG mock of a shared week grid, slow scroll-reveal pacing", "probability": 0.3}, {"direction": "Product-first demo: the hero IS a live, interactive mini week-planner users can drag tasks around, minimal copy around it", "probability": 0.25}, {"direction": "Bold gradient tech: deep ocean-blue to teal gradients, glassmorphism cards, big sans-serif headlines, floating UI snapshots", "probability": 0.15}, {"direction": "Hand-drawn warmth: sketchy SVG illustrations, sticky-note and card motifs, playful rotated elements, friendly rounded type", "probability": 0.15}, {"direction": "Swiss grid minimal: strict black-on-white typographic system, thin rules, monospace accents, tiny monochrome diagram of team rituals", "probability": 0.15}], "pick": {"direction": "Bold gradient tech: deep ocean-blue to teal gradients, glassmorphism cards, big sans-serif headlines, floating UI snapshots", "probability": 0.15}, "html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>Tidepool \u2014 Plan your week together</title>\n<style>\n  * { margin:0; padding:0; box-sizing:border-box; }\n  html { scroll-behavior:smooth; }\n  body {\n    font-family: 'Segoe UI', 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif;\n    color:#eaf6fb;\n    background:#03121f;\n    overflow-x:hidden;\n    line-height:1.6;\n  }\n  ::selection { background:#14b8a6; color:#03121f; }\n\n  /* ---------- Global gradient background ---------- */\n  .bg {\n    position:fixed; inset:0; z-index:-2;\n    background:\n      radial-gradient(1200px 800px at 85% -10%, rgba(20,184,166,.35), transparent 60%),\n      radial-gradient(1000px 700px at -10% 30%, rgba(14,116,144,.45), transparent 60%),\n      radial-gradient(900px 900px at 50% 110%, rgba(13,148,136,.28), transparent 60%),\n      linear-gradient(180deg, #03121f 0%, #062033 40%, #062b38 70%, #04252e 100%);\n  }\n  .bg::after {\n    content:\"\"; position:absolute; inset:0;\n    background-image:\n      radial-gradient(rgba(255,255,255,.06) 1px, transparent 1px);\n    background-size:32px 32px;\n    mask-image:linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(0,0,0,.9), transparent 70%);\n  }\n\n  .wrap { max-width:1140px; margin:0 auto; padding:0 24px; }\n\n  /* ---------- Nav ---------- */\n  header {\n    position:sticky; top:0; z-index:50;\n    backdrop-filter:blur(16px); -webkit-backdrop-filter:blur(16px);\n    background:rgba(3,18,31,.55);\n    border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.08);\n  }\n  nav { display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:space-between; padding:18px 0; }\n  .logo { display:flex; align-items:center; gap:10px; font-weight:800; font-size:1.25rem; letter-spacing:-.02em; }\n  .logo-mark {\n    width:34px; height:34px; border-radius:10px;\n    background:linear-gradient(135deg,#0ea5e9,#14b8a6);\n    display:grid; place-items:center; font-size:18px;\n    box-shadow:0 0 24px rgba(20,184,166,.5);\n  }\n  nav ul { display:flex; gap:28px; list-style:none; }\n  nav a { color:#b9d9e6; text-decoration:none; font-size:.92rem; font-weight:500; transition:color .2s; }\n  nav a:hover { color:#fff; }\n  .btn {\n    display:inline-block; padding:12px 26px; border-radius:999px;\n    font-weight:700; font-size:.95rem; text-decoration:none; cursor:pointer;\n    border:none; transition:transform .2s, box-shadow .2s;\n  }\n  .btn-primary {\n    background:linear-gradient(135deg,#0ea5e9,#14b8a6);\n    color:#03121f;\n    box-shadow:0 8px 30px rgba(20,184,166,.4);\n  }\n  .btn-primary:hover { transform:translateY(-2px); box-shadow:0 12px 40px rgba(20,184,166,.55); }\n  .btn-ghost {\n    color:#eaf6fb; border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.25);\n    background:rgba(255,255,255,.05); backdrop-filter:blur(8px);\n  }\n  .btn-ghost:hover { background:rgba(255,255,255,.12); transform:translateY(-2px); }\n\n  /* ---------- Hero ---------- */\n  .hero { position:relative; padding:90px 0 40px; text-align:center; }\n  .pill {\n    display:inline-flex; align-items:center; gap:8px;\n    padding:8px 18px; border-radius:999px; font-size:.82rem; font-weight:600;\n    background:rgba(20,184,166,.12); border:1px solid rgba(20,184,166,.35);\n    color:#7ce8d8; letter-spacing:.04em; text-transform:uppercase;\n    margin-bottom:28px;\n  }\n  h1 {\n    font-size:clamp(2.6rem, 6.5vw, 4.6rem);\n    font-weight:800; letter-spacing:-.03em; line-height:1.05;\n  }\n  h1 .grad {\n    background:linear-gradient(90deg,#38bdf8,#2dd4bf,#5eead4);\n    -webkit-background-clip:text; background-clip:text; color:transparent;\n  }\n  .hero p.sub {\n    max-width:560px; margin:24px auto 36px;\n    color:#a9cbdb; font-size:1.15rem;\n  }\n  .hero-ctas { display:flex; gap:16px; justify-content:center; flex-wrap:wrap; }\n  .hero-note { margin-top:16px; font-size:.85rem; color:#6f95a6; }\n\n  /* ---------- Floating UI snapshots ---------- */\n  .snapshots {\n    position:relative; margin:70px auto 0; max-width:1000px; height:480px;\n  }\n  .glass {\n    background:rgba(255,255,255,.07);\n    border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.14);\n    backdrop-filter:blur(20px); -webkit-backdrop-filter:blur(20px);\n    border-radius:20px;\n    box-shadow:0 24px 60px rgba(0,0,0,.4), inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,.15);\n  }\n  .snap { position:absolute; padding:22px; text-align:left; }\n  .snap-label { font-size:.7rem; text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:.12em; color:#7ce8d8; font-weight:700; margin-bottom:14px; }\n  .snap-1 {\n    width:340px; left:6%; top:20px; z-index:3;\n    animation:float1 7s ease-in-out infinite;\n  }\n  .snap-2 {\n    width:300px; right:5%; top:80px; z-index:2;\n    animation:float2 8s ease-in-out infinite;\n  }\n  .snap-3 {\n    width:380px; left:50%; transform:translateX(-50%); top:230px; z-index:4;\n    animation:float3 9s ease-in-out infinite;\n  }\n  @keyframes float1 { 50% { transform:translateY(-14px); } }\n  @keyframes float2 { 50% { transform:translateY(12px); } }\n  @keyframes float3 { 0%,100% { transform:translateX(-50%) translateY(0); } 50% { transform:translateX(-50%) translateY(-12px); } }\n\n  .task { display:flex; align-items:center; gap:12px; padding:10px 0; border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.07); font-size:.88rem; }\n  .task:last-child { border:none; }\n  .chk {\n    width:20px; height:20px; border-radius:6px; flex-shrink:0;\n    display:grid; place-items:center; font-size:12px;\n  }\n  .chk.done { background:linear-gradient(135deg,#0ea5e9,#14b8a6); color:#03121f; }\n  .chk.todo { border:1.5px solid rgba(255,255,255,.3); }\n  .tag { margin-left:auto; font-size:.68rem; padding:3px 10px; border-radius:999px; font-weight:700; }\n  .tag.b { background:rgba(56,189,248,.18); color:#7dd3fc; }\n  .tag.t { background:rgba(45,212,191,.18); color:#5eead4; }\n  .tag.p { background:rgba(250,204,21,.15); color:#fde047; }\n\n  .avatar-row { display:flex; margin-bottom:16px; }\n  .avatar {\n    width:34px; height:34px; border-radius:50%; margin-left:-8px;\n    border:2px solid rgba(3,18,31,.8);\n    display:grid; place-items:center; font-size:.72rem; font-weight:800; color:#03121f;\n  }\n  .avatar:first-child { margin-left:0; }\n  .bar { height:8px; border-radius:999px; background:rgba(255,255,255,.1); overflow:hidden; margin:10px 0 16px; }\n  .bar > div { height:100%; border-radius:999px; background:linear-gradient(90deg,#0ea5e9,#14b8a6); }\n  .mini-stat { display:flex; justify-content:space-between; font-size:.82rem; color:#b9d9e6; }\n  .mini-stat b { color:#fff; font-size:1.05rem; }\n\n  .cal-row { display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(5,1fr); gap:8px; }\n  .cal-day { text-align:center; font-size:.72rem; color:#8fb8ca; }\n  .cal-cell { height:44px; border-radius:10px; background:rgba(255,255,255,.06); margin-top:6px; position:relative; }\n  .cal-cell.hi { background:linear-gradient(135deg,rgba(14,165,233,.5),rgba(20,184,166,.5)); }\n  .cal-cell.hi2 { background:rgba(250,204,21,.25); }\n\n  @media (max-width:900px){\n    .snapshots { height:auto; }\n    .snap { position:relative; width:auto !important; left:auto !important; right:auto !important; top:auto !important; transform:none !important; margin:20px auto; max-width:420px; }\n    nav ul { display:none; }\n  }\n\n  /* ---------- Sections ---------- */\n  section { padding:90px 0; }\n  .eyebrow { color:#7ce8d8; font-weight:700; text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:.14em; font-size:.78rem; margin-bottom:14px; }\n  h2 { font-size:clamp(1.9rem, 4vw, 2.8rem); font-weight:800; letter-spacing:-.02em; line-height:1.15; }\n  .sec-sub { color:#a9cbdb; max-width:520px; margin-top:16px; }\n\n  .features { display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(280px,1fr)); gap:24px; margin-top:50px; }\n  .feature { padding:34px 28px; transition:transform .25s, box-shadow .25s; }\n  .feature:hover { transform:translateY(-6px); box-shadow:0 30px 70px rgba(0,0,0,.5), inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,.2); }\n  .f-icon {\n    width:52px; height:52px; border-radius:14px; display:grid; place-items:center;\n    font-size:24px; margin-bottom:20px;\n    background:linear-gradient(135deg,rgba(14,165,233,.3),rgba(20,184,166,.3));\n    border:1px solid rgba(125,211,252,.3);\n  }\n  .feature h3 { font-size:1.2rem; margin-bottom:10px; letter-spacing:-.01em; }\n  .feature p { color:#a9cbdb; font-size:.95rem; }\n\n  /* ---------- Steps ---------- */\n  .steps { display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(240px,1fr)); gap:24px; margin-top:50px; counter-reset:step; }\n  .step { padding:30px; position:relative; }\n  .step-num {\n    font-size:3rem; font-weight:800; line-height:1;\n    background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(125,211,252,.7),rgba(20,184,166,.15));\n    -webkit-background-clip:text; background-clip:text; color:transparent;\n    margin-bottom:14px;\n  }\n  .step h3 { font-size:1.1rem; margin-bottom:8px; }\n  .step p { color:#a9cbdb; font-size:.92rem; }\n\n  /* ---------- Social proof ---------- */\n  .quote-card { max-width:760px; margin:50px auto 0; padding:44px; text-align:center; }\n  .quote { font-size:1.35rem; font-weight:600; line-height:1.5; letter-spacing:-.01em; }\n  .quote span { color:#5eead4; }\n  .quote-who { margin-top:20px; color:#8fb8ca; font-size:.9rem; }\n  .quote-who b { color:#eaf6fb; display:block; }\n  .logos { display:flex; justify-content:center; gap:44px; flex-wrap:wrap; margin-top:36px; color:#5a8095; font-weight:700; letter-spacing:.08em; font-size:.85rem; }\n\n  /* ---------- CTA band ---------- */\n  .cta-band {\n    text-align:center; padding:70px 40px; border-radius:28px;\n    background:linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(14,165,233,.25), rgba(20,184,166,.25));\n    border:1px solid rgba(125,211,252,.25);\n    position:relative; overflow:hidden;\n  }\n  .cta-band::before {\n    content:\"\"; position:absolute; inset:-50%;\n    background:radial-gradient(circle at 30% 30%, rgba(56,189,248,.18), transparent 50%),\n               radial-gradient(circle at 70% 70%, rgba(94,234,212,.18), transparent 50%);\n    animation:swirl 12s ease-in-out infinite alternate;\n  }\n  @keyframes swirl { to { transform:rotate(12deg) scale(1.1); } }\n  .cta-band > * { position:relative; }\n  .cta-band h2 { margin-bottom:16px; }\n  .cta-band p { color:#b9d9e6; max-width:480px; margin:0 auto 30px; }\n\n  footer { border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.08); padding:40px 0; margin-top:60px; }\n  .foot { display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:center; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:16px; color:#6f95a6; font-size:.88rem; }\n  .foot-links { display:flex; gap:24px; }\n  .foot-links a { color:#6f95a6; text-decoration:none; }\n  .foot-links a:hover { color:#eaf6fb; }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"bg\"></div>\n\n<header>\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <nav>\n      <div class=\"logo\"><div class=\"logo-mark\">\ud83c\udf0a</div> Tidepool</div>\n      <ul>\n        <li><a href=\"#features\">Features</a></li>\n        <li><a href=\"#how\">How it works</a></li>\n        <li><a href=\"#stories\">Teams</a></li>\n      </ul>\n      <a class=\"btn btn-primary\" href=\"#cta\">Get started</a>\n    </nav>\n  </div>\n</header>\n\n<main class=\"wrap\">\n\n  <!-- HERO -->\n  <div class=\"hero\">\n    <div class=\"pill\">\u2726 New \u2014 Shared weekly rituals</div>\n    <h1>Plan your week <span class=\"grad\">together</span>,<br>not in silos.</h1>\n    <p class=\"sub\">Tidepool turns scattered to-dos into one shared weekly rhythm. Fifteen minutes every Monday, and your whole team is in sync.</p>\n    <div class=\"hero-ctas\">\n      <a class=\"btn btn-primary\" href=\"#cta\">Start planning free \u2192</a>\n      <a class=\"btn btn-ghost\" href=\"#how\">See how it works</a>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"hero-note\">Free for teams up to 5 \u00b7 No credit card required</div>\n\n    <!-- Floating UI snapshots -->\n    <div class=\"snapshots\">\n      <div class=\"glass snap snap-1\">\n        <div class=\"snap-label\">This week's focus</div>\n        <div class=\"task\"><div class=\"chk done\">\u2713</div> Ship pricing page <span class=\"tag t\">Done</span></div>\n        <div class=\"task\"><div class=\"chk done\">\u2713</div> User interviews \u00d75 <span class=\"tag t\">Done</span></div>\n        <div class=\"task\"><div class=\"chk todo\"></div> Draft Q3 roadmap <span class=\"tag b\">In progress</span></div>\n        <div class=\"task\"><div class=\"chk todo\"></div> Fix onboarding bug <span class=\"tag p\">Priority</span></div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"glass snap snap-2\">\n        <div class=\"snap-label\">Team pulse</div>\n        <div class=\"avatar-row\">\n          <div class=\"avatar\" style=\"background:linear-gradient(135deg,#38bdf8,#0ea5e9)\">MK</div>\n          <div class=\"avatar\" style=\"background:linear-gradient(135deg,#2dd4bf,#14b8a6)\">JL</div>\n          <div class=\"avatar\" style=\"background:linear-gradient(135deg,#5eead4,#0d9488)\">AR</div>\n          <div class=\"avatar\" style=\"background:rgba(255,255,255,.15)\">+4</div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"mini-stat\"><span>Week progress</span><b>72%</b></div>\n        <div class=\"bar\"><div style=\"width:72%\"></div></div>\n        <div class=\"mini-stat\"><span>Capacity used</span><b>8.5 / 10d</b></div>\n        <div class=\"bar\"><div style=\"width:85%\"></div></div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"glass snap snap-3\">\n        <div class=\"snap-label\">Shared board \u00b7 Week 28</div>\n        <div class=\"cal-row\">\n          <div class=\"cal-day\">Mon<div class=\"cal-cell\"></div></div>\n          <div class=\"cal-day\">Tue<div class=\"cal-cell hi\"></div></div>\n          <div class=\"cal-day\">Wed<div class=\"cal-cell\"></div></div>\n          <div class=\"cal-day\">Thu<div class=\"cal-cell hi2\"></div></div>\n          <div class=\"cal-day\">Fri<div class=\"cal-cell hi\"></div></div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"mini-stat\" style=\"margin-top:16px\"><span>Planning ritual</span><span style=\"color:#5eead4\">Mon \u00b7 9:30 \u00b7 15 min \u2713</span></div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- FEATURES -->\n  <section id=\"features\">\n    <div class=\"eyebrow\">Why Tidepool</div>\n    <h2>Everything a small team needs.<br>Nothing it doesn't.</h2>\n    <p class=\"sec-sub\">No bloated project suites. Just the lightweight tools that keep a handful of people moving in the same direction.</p>\n    <div class=\"features\">\n      <div class=\"glass feature\">\n        <div class=\"f-icon\">\ud83d\uddd3\ufe0f</div>\n        <h3>Weekly planning ritual</h3>\n        <p>A guided 15-minute session every Monday where the team picks priorities together \u2014 then Tidepool keeps everyone honest all week.</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"glass feature\">\n        <div class=\"f-icon\">\ud83d\udc40</div>\n        <h3>Full-team visibility</h3>\n        <p>See what everyone is focused on at a glance. Spot overloaded weeks and redistribute before Friday crunch hits.</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"glass feature\">\n        <div class=\"f-icon\">\ud83c\udf0a</div>\n        <h3>Gentle nudges</h3>\n        <p>Slack-friendly reminders and Friday retro prompts keep momentum flowing \u2014 without another meeting on the calendar.</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- HOW IT WORKS -->\n  <section id=\"how\">\n    <div class=\"eyebrow\">How it works</div>\n    <h2>Three steps. One calm week.</h2>\n    <div class=\"steps\">\n      <div class=\"glass step\">\n        <div class=\"step-num\">01</div>\n        <h3>Pour it in</h3>\n        <p>Dump every task, idea, and maybe into your team's pool. Import from Slack, docs, or your head.</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"glass step\">\n        <div class=\"step-num\">02</div>\n        <h3>Plan Monday</h3>\n        <p>In one short ritual, the team picks what matters this week and who's on what. Done before coffee cools.</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"glass step\">\n        <div class=\"step-num\">03</div>\n        <h3>Ride the week</h3>\n        <p>Tidepool tracks progress, flags drift, and wraps the week with a lightweight retro. Then repeat.</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- SOCIAL PROOF -->\n  <section id=\"stories\">\n    <div class=\"eyebrow\">Teams in the flow</div>\n    <h2>Small teams, big current.</h2>\n    <div class=\"glass quote-card\">\n      <p class=\"quote\">\"We replaced three tools and a status meeting with one Monday ritual. Our standups got shorter, our Fridays got calmer, and <span>nothing falls through the cracks anymore.</span>\"</p>\n      <div class=\"quote-who\"><b>Maya Kessler</b>Co-founder, Driftline Studio (12 people)</div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"logos\">\n      <span>DRIFTLINE</span><span>NORTHKIT</span><span>SEAGRASS&nbsp;LABS</span><span>HARBOR&nbsp;&amp;&nbsp;CO</span><span>PILOTWAVE</span>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- CTA -->\n  <section id=\"cta\">\n    <div class=\"cta-band\">\n      <h2>Catch the next tide.</h2>\n      <p>Set up your team's first weekly ritual in under five minutes. Your future Fridays will thank you.</p>\n      <a class=\"btn btn-primary\" href=\"#\" style=\"font-size:1.05rem; padding:16px 36px;\">Start planning free \u2192</a>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n</main>\n\n<footer>\n  <div class=\"wrap foot\">\n    <div class=\"logo\" style=\"font-size:1rem\"><div class=\"logo-mark\" style=\"width:26px;height:26px;font-size:14px;border-radius:8px\">\ud83c\udf0a</div> Tidepool</div>\n    <div class=\"foot-links\">\n      <a href=\"#\">Privacy</a><a href=\"#\">Terms</a><a href=\"#\">Changelog</a><a href=\"#\">Contact</a>\n    </div>\n    <span>\u00a9 2025 Tidepool. Ride the wave.</span>\n  </div>\n</footer>\n\n</body>\n</html>\n"}